  "question": {
    "text": "A pendulum has an angular amplitude&nbsp;<math><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></math>. The tension in the string at extreme position is T<sub>1</sub> and at the bottom is T<sub>2</sub>. If it is known that T<sub>2</sub> = 2T<sub>1</sub>, then what is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi></math>?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "0.75",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>T</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>mg cos</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ..... (1)<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>T</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>mg</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>mv</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>m</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>gh</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>mg</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>mg</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or &nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>T</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>mg</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>mg</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ....... (2)<br /><br /><u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0021690_AnsExp_1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 273px; height: 193px;\" /></strong></u><br /><br />Given T<sub>2</sub> = 2T<sub>1</sub><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>mg</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>mg</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>2mg cos</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 0.75",
